Qualify the nested Publisher/Subscriber/Subject types with `Combine.`

OpenCombine writes `OpenCombine.Publisher` wherever a nested type named
`Publisher` would otherwise shadow the protocol. Built with
`-module-name Combine` there is no module called `OpenCombine`, so those
references have to name this module instead.

The qualifier is not part of a mangled name, so this changes none of them.

